@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Danh gia & Binh luan phim (Movie Reviews)
autonumber
skinparam maxMessageSize 220

actor "Khach hang\n(Customer)" as KH
boundary "Giao dien Chi tiet Phim\n(Web UI)" as UI
control "Review Controller\n(Backend API)" as BE
database "Co so du lieu\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

KH -> UI : Chon phim va xem muc Danh gia phim
UI -> BE : Yeu cau danh sach danh gia & diem trung binh
BE -> DB : Truy van danh sach Reviews & diem Rating cua phim
DB --> BE : Tra du lieu danh gia
BE --> UI : Tra danh sach danh gia & diem trung binh
UI --> KH : Hien thi danh sach binh luan va bieu mau danh gia

KH -> UI : Chon so sao (1-5 sao) va nhap binh luan (<= 1000 ky tu)
KH -> UI : Nhan nut "Gui danh gia"
UI -> BE : Gui du lieu danh gia (movieId, rating, comment, JWT)

BE -> BE : Kiem tra xac thuc dang nhap (JWT)\nva hop le du lieu (1-5 sao, <= 1000 ky tu)\n(Khong bat buoc da mua ve)

alt Chua dang nhap hoac du lieu khong hop le
    BE --> UI : Tra loi 401/400 (Yeu cau dang nhap / Sai dinh dang)
    UI --> KH : Hien thi thong bao loi
else Hop le
    BE -> DB : Kiem tra khach da danh gia phim nay chua (userId, movieId)
    DB --> BE : Tra ket qua kiem tra

    alt Da tung danh gia truoc do (FR-REV-02)
        BE -> DB : Cap nhat (UPDATE) so sao, binh luan va updatedAt
        DB --> BE : Xac nhan cap nhat thanh cong
    else Danh gia lan dau
        BE -> DB : Them moi (INSERT) ban ghi danh gia
        DB --> BE : Xac nhan luu moi thanh cong
    end

    BE -> DB : Tinh lai diem trung binh cua phim\n(lam tron 1 chu so thap phan - FR-REV-03)
    DB --> BE : Xac nhan cap nhat Movie.rating

    BE --> UI : Tra ket qua danh gia thanh cong & diem moi
    UI --> KH : Hien thi thong bao thanh cong va cap nhat giao dien
end
@enduml